        "AbstractText": "A palladium-catalyzed asymmetric redox-relay Heck reaction of 4H-chromenes and arylboronic acids has been successfully developed. The reaction proceeded in moderate to good yields with good to high enantioselectivities. The resulting product is an advanced intermediate of bio-active compound BW683C."
